  "context": "## Case Study: HT\nChanging the person so the organization can see what it could not — the perspective engine behind JUBAP.\n\nWithin the Nueva Perspectiva philosophy · Stewarded by The Integral Management Society / IMSV.org\n\nA company changes when the people inside it can see and do what they could not before. That is why our organizational work is paired with a discipline of human transformation — and why both live inside the same philosophy: Nueva Perspectiva .\n\nMindfulness is often what people notice first, but it is only one instrument. Human transformation is the broader practice: transpersonal coaching, experiential work, deep personal retreats, emotional intelligence and conscious attention — chosen and combined for the situation. The aim is never a pleasant experience that fades. It is a genuine change of perspective that lets a person locate their own blockages, see new options, and act.\n\nJUBAP is Nueva Perspectiva put to work. The framework moves in two directions — and human transformation powers one of them.\nEtiquetas: Capacidad humana y deuda de inteligencia 6.90%; Casos de uso y aplicaciones 17.24%; Empresa y gestión 24.14%; Cambio de perspectiva 27.58%; Transformación y continuidad operativa 24.14%\nFicha: https://dakleyer.github.io/perspective-beyond/sources/case-study-ht-e1630/\nDocumento de origen: https://jubap.eu/human-transformation/\n\n",
